+<p id="form-error" class="error" role="alert"></p>
+<button class="submit" type="submit">确认报名信息 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
+<p class="privacy"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="10" height="7" rx="1.5"/><path d="M5 7V5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v2M8 10v2"/></svg>信息仅在当前页面展示，刷新后清空</p>
+</form>
+<div id="confirmation" class="confirmation" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="confirmation-title"><div class="success-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div><h3 id="confirmation-title">报名信息已准备好</h3><p>感谢你的参与！请核对以下信息。<br>当前为演示页面，尚未向主办方提交报名。</p><dl id="summary" class="summary"></dl><button class="reset" id="edit-button" type="button">返回修改信息</button></div>
+</section>
